  "decision_assessment": {
    "local_maintenance": "Supported as a useful finite representation result. Near the declared autonomous origin, quartic41-node error oscillations0.0004693343653343618 and0.0005213862750679255 are much lower than affine0.026174860817263834 and0.02270727977156639. Two accepted suffix steps improve the computed audited common objective by17.483263450325467 relative to the unchanged origin at the same294000 prefix.",
    "public_origin_fidelity": "Inadequate over the tested neighborhood around a7. Quartic41-node error oscillations37737.81091269478 and43235.597793426365 cannot be removed by a parameter-independent offset. This conclusion does not depend on the optimization outcome.",
    "public_search_separate_limit": "Final h0=-0.9991571349280706 lies near the lower physical bound. All8 final trial fractions at each checkpoint violate h0>=-1; even alpha1/128 gives-1.0007264597635643/-1.0029309945704639. No costs are evaluated there. A7 has lower represented likelihood cost than the returned public candidate, so do not claim the best constrained sketch point, stationarity or compression as the sole cause of poor point discovery.",
    "warm_stop": "All8 final fractions are evaluated, with largest computed decreases5.020410753786564e-9 and3.9959559217095375e-8 below cost allowances at least4.6035362772793285e-7 and5.590039242406776e-7. The declared no-accepted-trial stop is unresolved; neither KKT nor nonlinear convergence is established.",
    "no_global_promotion": "The warm sketch has all42-node quartic oscillations589270485.8791023 and584203745.884426 when the distant public point is included. Local behavior cannot be promoted to a global historical likelihood or posterior certificate.",
    "state_transport": "SOC exactly matches the original model for all4 audited candidates. RC/h transport away from origin remains approximate; final warm h error-1.5064061109626437e-11 is a same-candidate model comparison, not truth accuracy.",
    "recommended_next": "Keep the qualified local C bank. Design a finite causal public-start bootstrap/transition with explicit ownership and approximation of all pre-origin evidence, plus a genuinely support-aware full-joint proposal. Better bound handling alone cannot recover discarded nonlinear information. No further run or old-study extension is authorized by this review."
